{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17133","headline":"青云干吕 二 · 彭伉","name":"青云干吕 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣布中区化，祥符异域云。\n含春初应吕，晕碧已成文。\n东起随风暖，西流共日曛。\n升时嘉异月，爲庆等凝汾。\n轻与晴烟比，高将晓雾分。\n飘飘如可致，愿此翊明君。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"彭伉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17133.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17133","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}